   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "ikke in subordinate clauses",
     "texto": [
      "In the main clause, **ikke** goes after the verb:\n\n- Jørgen spiser **ikke** frokost.\n\nIn a subordinate clause (fordi, hvis, når, som, at…), **ikke goes BEFORE the verb**:\n\n- … fordi han **ikke** spiste frokost.\n- … som han **ikke** har set.\n\nAnd no inversion in the subordinate clause!"
     ],
     "tutora": "pensando"
    },
